type: dataset
title: "Agent Incident Atlas"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
abstract: >-
  An open dataset and failure taxonomy for anonymized agentic AI incidents,
  organized for research and AI governance postmortems in enterprise AI.
  Version 0.1.0 contains 20 illustrative seed records and no real incidents.
